{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53193","headline":"诗偈 十八 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无有报庞大，空空无处坐。\n家内空空空，空空无有货。\n日在空里行，日没空里卧。\n空坐空吟诗，诗空空相和。\n莫怪纯用空，空是诸佛座。\n世人不别宝，空即是实货。\n若嫌无有空，自是诸佛定。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}